---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---
<section class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 px-6 pt-24 pb-12 text-center">
	<pre class="text-[10px] leading-tight text-neutral-400 sm:text-xs" aria-label="cca">
 ██████╗ ██████╗ █████╗
██╔════╝██╔════╝██╔══██╗
██║     ██║     ███████║
██║     ██║     ██╔══██║
╚██████╗╚██████╗██║  ██║
 ╚═════╝ ╚═════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝</pre>
	<h1 class="max-w-2xl text-2xl font-medium text-neutral-100 sm:text-3xl">
		Good enough to be your default agent, simple enough to be your research substrate.
	</h1>
	<div class="flex gap-3">
		<a
			href={`${base}docs/configuration/`}
			class="border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-100 px-5 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-neutral-950 hover:bg-neutral-300"
		>
			Get started
		</a>
		<a
			href="https://github.com/CCA-sh/CCA"
			class="border border-neutral-700 px-5 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-neutral-100 hover:border-neutral-400"
		>
			GitHub
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
